WEBVTT

00:01.465 --> 00:03.795
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.835 --> 00:07.025
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.465 --> 00:10.065
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.235 --> 00:14.975
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.315 --> 00:20.875
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.315 --> 00:26.885
Dragon Drive

00:26.925 --> 00:32.455
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.765 --> 00:35.385
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.465 --> 00:38.695
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.205 --> 00:43.535
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.575 --> 00:45.405
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.505 --> 00:51.875
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.585 --> 00:55.845
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.915 --> 00:59.255
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.585 --> 01:04.355
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.495 --> 01:06.085
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.165 --> 01:08.495
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.665 --> 01:11.895
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.205 --> 01:17.105
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.305 --> 01:20.035
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.075 --> 01:27.745
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.195 --> 01:44.395
The Dragonite Kouhei took with him
is not what Shinryu is sealed in.

01:44.705 --> 01:45.685
Chibi.

01:45.905 --> 01:47.365
Open your eyes for me.

01:47.435 --> 01:49.565
I brought you the medicinal herbs.

01:49.905 --> 01:52.105
Wake up, Chibi!

01:52.575 --> 01:55.405
Without you, I...

02:03.385 --> 02:04.575
Eager Striker.

02:06.085 --> 02:07.075
Now!

02:10.155 --> 02:12.385
Chibi seems different than usual.

02:14.465 --> 02:15.455
Go!

02:17.335 --> 02:19.325
Thank you, Eager Striker.

02:21.105 --> 02:24.335
Rites of Passage

02:25.245 --> 02:27.805
What?! The dragons have all gone away?!

02:28.575 --> 02:30.135
This is no time to be sitting back,
acting calm!

02:30.175 --> 02:31.165
Shut up!

02:31.215 --> 02:34.445
All the dragons from this area
have left on their own!

02:34.955 --> 02:38.075
I don't know what happened, but it was
like they were being called by someone!

02:38.185 --> 02:39.115
By someone?

02:39.455 --> 02:40.425
Yeah!

02:40.455 --> 02:43.015
Thanks to that, I've had
to close shop ever since!

02:44.225 --> 02:45.955
Could it be from then?

02:52.965 --> 02:57.905
As I recall, it was like all the dragons
from Rikyu gathered in one place.

03:00.275 --> 03:01.935
This isn't good.

03:02.375 --> 03:04.275
We were preparing for our final battle...

03:04.315 --> 03:07.685
...by getting together many skilled people
on our side in the battle against RI-ON...

03:07.785 --> 03:08.755
Right.

03:08.785 --> 03:10.945
But the way things look,
that's gonna be impossible.

03:11.625 --> 03:13.615
Want me to help you fight them?

03:17.525 --> 03:19.425
You're that bastard's teammate!

03:19.765 --> 03:21.055
Thundervolt!

03:22.435 --> 03:23.955
Hold your horses, old man.

03:23.995 --> 03:25.335
O-Old man?

03:25.905 --> 03:27.395
Who are you calling "old man"?!

03:27.705 --> 03:29.765
I'm no longer with Kouhei...

03:29.975 --> 03:31.465
...and I didn't come here to fight you.

03:32.145 --> 03:34.475
Are you seriously offering
to join forces with us?

03:34.715 --> 03:35.695
Yeah.

03:36.215 --> 03:38.705
But I have one condition.

03:39.245 --> 03:40.975
So, what's the condition?

03:42.015 --> 03:43.485
I want to meet with Miss Meguru.

03:44.085 --> 03:45.075
Huh?

03:45.155 --> 03:47.745
What? You have a crush on Meguru?

03:48.355 --> 03:50.755
No. Nothing like that.

03:50.995 --> 03:52.685
There's something I want to tell her.

03:53.325 --> 03:55.425
L-Like, "I love you"?

03:55.765 --> 03:57.425
I'm telling you, it's nothing like that!

03:58.265 --> 04:00.465
What about Hikaru? Isn't he with you?

04:00.965 --> 04:04.205
He went flying off alone, in search of Reiji.

04:04.645 --> 04:07.335
By the way, why isn't he with you?

04:08.145 --> 04:10.235
He's gone off alone to do some training.

04:10.645 --> 04:11.845
Training?

04:12.245 --> 04:13.235
Yes.

04:13.485 --> 04:15.475
I wonder where he is about now.

04:29.065 --> 04:30.625
Boy, I'm hungry.

04:31.165 --> 04:35.155
It seems to me that we're wandering
further and further into trouble.

04:40.075 --> 04:42.665
Why am I the only one
who has to come to a place like this?

04:43.145 --> 04:45.305
You're still much too weak.

04:46.145 --> 04:48.045
But Chibi's matured, right?!

04:48.085 --> 04:49.645
Then there's nothing to worry about!

04:52.755 --> 04:56.695
Certainly, Senkohcoola did recover
from a near-death situation.

04:57.425 --> 05:00.585
But that's still not nearly enough power
to fight against those guys!

05:01.195 --> 05:03.755
You must not only find others
to join you in your battle...

05:03.835 --> 05:05.455
...you must also train to become stronger.

05:05.765 --> 05:07.065
Train?

05:07.435 --> 05:10.065
Why not have Reiji and Chibi look for...

05:10.105 --> 05:11.865
...the legendary dragon, SinnSaber?

05:12.305 --> 05:13.675
SinnSaber?

05:14.075 --> 05:15.445
That's a good idea.

05:15.715 --> 05:18.875
The journey to find it should prove to be
valuable training for Senkohcoola as well.

05:19.385 --> 05:21.545
Legendary dragon?

05:21.585 --> 05:23.245
SinnSaber?

05:23.285 --> 05:24.515
What's that?

05:24.625 --> 05:28.485
It's a truly strong dragon
said to live in Rikyu from long ago.

05:29.125 --> 05:30.685
Where will I find it?

05:31.425 --> 05:32.795
I don't know.

05:33.095 --> 05:37.295
I don't know, but I know that if you
do successfully find and defeat SinnSaber...

05:37.365 --> 05:40.135
...you will be able
to acquire all of its powers!

05:43.375 --> 05:46.605
How am I supposed to find
a legendary dragon...

05:46.905 --> 05:48.845
...that no one knows where to find?

05:48.915 --> 05:49.895
Darn it.

05:55.815 --> 05:58.145
Wh-Wh-What's that?!

05:59.785 --> 06:02.315
W-W-Wait a minute! Wait!

06:03.955 --> 06:05.755
Chibi! Chibi!

06:05.795 --> 06:07.155
Where are you?! Where'd you go?!

06:07.325 --> 06:08.555
Could he be?!

06:09.165 --> 06:10.425
Damn you!

06:13.605 --> 06:16.095
You swallowed Chibi, didn't you?

06:16.475 --> 06:18.235
Hey! Spit him out!

06:23.975 --> 06:27.745
So that's where you were, Chibi.

06:33.225 --> 06:35.055
Damn! How dare you!

06:35.255 --> 06:36.915
Let's go get him, Chibi!

06:37.395 --> 06:39.795
Wh-Wh-What the?!

06:40.625 --> 06:42.895
C-Could this be a bottomless swamp?!

06:53.075 --> 06:54.975
Y-Young man!

06:55.715 --> 07:00.115
I'm the candidate to be the next chief
of Chantan Village's self-defense troops...

07:00.145 --> 07:02.135
My name is K-Kohryu!

07:02.815 --> 07:05.785
I-I'll distract that dragon...

07:06.085 --> 07:08.575
...so h-hurry out of there while I do that!

07:08.625 --> 07:10.985
As I was saying, I'm in a bottomless swamp!

07:13.225 --> 07:14.855
H-Here it comes!

07:21.105 --> 07:22.095
Watch out!

07:28.975 --> 07:30.415
What's going on?

07:30.445 --> 07:32.145
Who did that?

07:32.185 --> 07:33.975
I've been looking for you, Reiji Ohzora!

07:35.355 --> 07:36.715
Hikaru Himuro!

07:36.885 --> 07:39.875
I don't know what
you guys are doing here now...

07:40.655 --> 07:42.645
...but I've come for
a decisive match against you.

07:43.055 --> 07:44.585
Accept my challenge, Reiji Ohzora!

07:45.065 --> 07:47.395
Is this guy a stalker?

07:48.465 --> 07:50.435
H-He's only a kid.

07:50.865 --> 07:53.335
But he destroyed that dragon
with a single shot.

07:56.875 --> 07:59.035
The shrine! This isn't good!

07:59.345 --> 08:01.675
Chief! Outsiders over by the shrine!

08:03.115 --> 08:05.405
Chief! The shrine has been destroyed!

08:07.145 --> 08:08.085
Kohryu!

08:08.115 --> 08:10.675
I thought I ordered you
to protect the shrine!

08:10.815 --> 08:13.185
How do you explain what happened here?!

08:13.285 --> 08:15.155
Ch-Chief. I can explain...

08:15.625 --> 08:17.255
I'm disappointed in you, Kohryu!

08:17.655 --> 08:21.325
At this rate, it's gonna be difficult
to accept you as a self-defense trooper!

08:21.735 --> 08:24.135
Yes. I'm terribly sorry.

08:24.695 --> 08:26.325
Who are those guys?

08:27.135 --> 08:28.535
Capture the outsiders!

08:29.275 --> 08:30.675
There's no saying what they'll do!

08:33.875 --> 08:35.305
- They're in my way. I'll erase them.
- Huh?!

08:35.615 --> 08:36.875
Stop it!

08:40.515 --> 08:42.545
What?! The shrine was destroyed?!

08:42.585 --> 08:44.485
Yeah. We're in trouble!

08:44.515 --> 08:47.215
We'd better give more than usual this time.

08:48.625 --> 08:50.115
Sorry, you two.

08:50.425 --> 08:52.825
This village is extra hard on outsiders.

08:53.625 --> 08:56.895
Not only that, but you guys also
destroyed the shrine, so...

08:57.395 --> 09:00.335
Is that shrine really that important?

09:00.705 --> 09:01.695
Yeah.

09:02.005 --> 09:06.165
It's a crucial item, to protect this village
from Genwakumemu.

09:06.375 --> 09:08.105
Genwakumemu?

09:08.545 --> 09:10.565
It happened ten years ago.

09:11.945 --> 09:15.475
A dragon by the name of Genwakumemu
suddenly appeared at our village...

09:15.615 --> 09:17.385
...and began to terrorize it.

09:17.785 --> 09:20.685
Under orders of the current chief,
the shrine was built...

09:20.885 --> 09:22.755
...and people began leaving gifts.

09:23.025 --> 09:25.455
Genwakumemu then calmed down.

09:27.425 --> 09:29.955
What a joke, giving gifts to a dragon.

09:30.435 --> 09:32.335
If it attacks, all you need to do is defeat it.

09:32.565 --> 09:33.595
What?!

09:33.635 --> 09:36.335
We would've done so
if the dragon were easy to defeat.

09:37.205 --> 09:39.765
Even the self-defense troops
can't do anything about that dragon.

09:40.145 --> 09:42.005
Saying that it's strong is an understatement.

09:42.475 --> 09:44.945
Are the self-defense troops
really that strong?

09:45.245 --> 09:46.405
Of course!

09:46.945 --> 09:49.505
And on top of that, they're super ultra cool!

09:49.955 --> 09:51.545
I'm only an apprentice at this point.

09:51.825 --> 09:53.215
But someday, I'll be accepted by them...

09:53.325 --> 09:57.085
...and I'll become a respected man who'll
protect the village, just like the Chief!

09:57.725 --> 09:58.925
But...

09:58.965 --> 10:01.155
I've been an apprentice for four years now.

10:01.195 --> 10:03.965
Maybe they're right...
maybe I'm just not suited for this.

10:04.235 --> 10:05.495
What are you saying?!

10:05.905 --> 10:07.365
You've been doing this for four years, right?

10:07.435 --> 10:09.135
The fact that you've continued for so long...

10:09.175 --> 10:10.965
...is a sign that you really like that job!

10:11.005 --> 10:12.835
Keep it up and you'll be a trooper someday!

10:12.875 --> 10:13.865
Good luck!

10:15.845 --> 10:16.975
You think so?

10:17.215 --> 10:20.575
Actually, I knew I was a late bloomer!

10:20.885 --> 10:24.045
Really? I think of myself the same way!

10:24.085 --> 10:25.985
- You too?!
- Yeah!

10:27.355 --> 10:28.915
Wh-What's RI-ON?

10:29.455 --> 10:31.425
They're bad guys...

10:31.595 --> 10:34.395
...who not only wanna take over Earth,
but also this world, Rikyu.

10:34.525 --> 10:36.585
And those guys will come and attack us?

10:36.895 --> 10:37.885
Mm-hm.

10:38.035 --> 10:42.335
That's why I need to find the legendary
dragon called SinnSaber before they return.

10:42.535 --> 10:44.595
Then I can go back to where
the others are waiting for me!

10:45.775 --> 10:48.605
Y-You guys are taking on
such an incredible mission?!

10:48.945 --> 10:51.575
A-Awesome! I'm deeply moved!

10:51.845 --> 10:53.605
Okay! Leave things to me!

10:53.945 --> 10:55.785
I'll make sure that you get outta here!

10:55.985 --> 10:58.175
I'm sure the Chief will understand
when I explain things!

10:58.355 --> 10:59.515
Just wait here!

11:00.825 --> 11:02.815
I'm counting on you, Kohryu!

11:04.025 --> 11:08.015
I can't imagine the guys in the village
will believe that story.

11:08.225 --> 11:09.355
What do you mean?!

11:12.235 --> 11:13.825
He's not the Chief for nothing.

11:13.865 --> 11:15.595
He's always on guard.

11:15.635 --> 11:18.905
He's guarding the village for everyone,
even if he has to do it alone.

11:23.745 --> 11:26.645
C-Could it be... Genwakumemu?

11:34.685 --> 11:36.815
C-Chief! But why?!

11:39.025 --> 11:40.925
Thanks to the commotion
caused by those outsiders today...

11:40.995 --> 11:43.155
...the gifts are better than usual.

11:43.735 --> 11:47.225
Although this still won't cover
my gambling debts.

11:57.215 --> 11:59.075
My lovely Genwakumemu.

12:00.115 --> 12:02.815
Why don't we threaten the village tonight,
for the first time in a while...

12:02.855 --> 12:04.585
...and have them give us even more gifts?

12:22.375 --> 12:23.205
Who's there?!

12:27.475 --> 12:28.465
Kohryu...

12:31.375 --> 12:33.105
Hey, Hikaru.

12:33.685 --> 12:35.675
You've been left behind by Kouhei.

12:35.755 --> 12:37.615
Aren't you at all upset with him?

12:39.125 --> 12:40.385
Left behind?

12:41.355 --> 12:42.985
You have that wrong.

12:43.755 --> 12:46.885
I've decided to remain in this world
under my own accord.

12:56.575 --> 13:00.065
I finally encountered that feeling.

13:00.705 --> 13:02.705
"That feeling", huh?

13:04.145 --> 13:05.135
Reiji!

13:05.315 --> 13:06.375
Kohryu!

13:09.785 --> 13:12.985
Why do we have to escape
through a place like this?

13:13.385 --> 13:17.445
Because we'd be in big trouble
if the Chief ever found us.

13:17.625 --> 13:18.685
Why's that?!

13:19.265 --> 13:20.245
Because...

13:22.435 --> 13:24.865
Hey, don't just stop there!

13:26.705 --> 13:27.895
What did you say?!

13:27.935 --> 13:30.265
The Chief and Genwakumemu
were in this together?!

13:30.575 --> 13:32.505
Yeah. That's the truth.

13:32.705 --> 13:35.105
Did you try to talk to the villagers about it?

13:35.715 --> 13:38.775
No one would listen
to an apprentice like myself.

13:38.945 --> 13:39.935
But...

13:40.385 --> 13:42.815
I wanna help the people of this village!

13:42.855 --> 13:44.515
Please help me!

13:44.585 --> 13:45.485
There they are!

13:47.055 --> 13:49.185
I knew I might find you here, Kohryu!

13:49.625 --> 13:52.355
So you guys planned this together,
just like the Chief said!

13:52.565 --> 13:53.685
Wait a minute!

13:53.895 --> 13:55.365
The Chief is the one who's doing wrong!

13:55.565 --> 13:57.365
The Chief's in this with Genwakumemu...

13:57.395 --> 13:58.225
Shut up! Shut up!

13:59.565 --> 14:02.035
You villains destroyed the shrine,
how dare you say such a thing!

14:02.305 --> 14:03.295
Chief!

14:03.775 --> 14:05.565
Everyone! You mustn't be deceived!

14:05.805 --> 14:08.005
Kohryu witnessed everything!

14:08.175 --> 14:09.165
That's a lie!

14:09.875 --> 14:12.715
Who'd believe anything an outsider
and an apprentice have to say?

14:12.745 --> 14:14.475
He's right! He's right!

14:14.515 --> 14:16.575
Because you guys wrecked the shrine...

14:16.815 --> 14:18.715
...Genwakumemu is very angry!

14:19.125 --> 14:21.315
The three of you shall take responsibility
for what you've done!

14:21.685 --> 14:22.815
Responsibility?

14:24.195 --> 14:25.185
Chief!

14:25.795 --> 14:30.565
What do you say we offer these three
to Genwakumemu, in order to calm it down?

14:30.835 --> 14:32.395
Hmm. What a good idea.

14:33.065 --> 14:35.765
What does that mean?
They want to turn us into monsters?

14:36.305 --> 14:37.965
No. He means offer us as human sacrifices.

14:38.175 --> 14:39.235
What?!

14:40.945 --> 14:43.605
We could solve your problem
by getting rid of Genwakumemu!

14:44.415 --> 14:45.745
Th-That's crazy!

14:45.815 --> 14:47.575
What can you guys do alone?

14:47.945 --> 14:49.975
Who knows, until we give it a try?!

14:50.515 --> 14:53.245
If we fail, we'll be sacrificed to the dragon.

14:53.685 --> 14:55.175
But if we succeed in getting rid of it...

14:55.695 --> 14:58.955
You shall take it as a sign
that we were telling the truth!

14:59.395 --> 15:00.325
What?!

15:00.425 --> 15:01.585
Also...

15:02.265 --> 15:05.925
I'll insist that you accept Kohryu
as a self-defense trooper!

15:06.035 --> 15:06.935
Huh?!

15:08.165 --> 15:10.605
The fog's gotten a lot thicker
compared to earlier in the day.

15:10.735 --> 15:13.705
Genwakumemu is causing this fog.

15:14.345 --> 15:16.105
Can we really defeat it?

15:16.345 --> 15:19.605
Kohryu, you wanna become
a self-defense trooper, right?

15:19.685 --> 15:21.375
Then have confidence in yourself!

15:21.785 --> 15:24.345
But there's no way
I can defeat Genwakumemu.

15:24.955 --> 15:26.185
It's impossible!

15:26.285 --> 15:27.515
Just the same!

15:27.555 --> 15:30.215
It's the job of the self-defense troops
to protect the village, isn't it?!

15:30.795 --> 15:31.785
Reiji...

15:39.505 --> 15:42.295
No one lives after finding out my secret.

15:42.905 --> 15:45.235
My lovely Genwakumemu.

15:45.745 --> 15:47.645
Take care of them as you feel appropriate.

15:48.445 --> 15:50.965
Okay, Chibi, hurry up and transform...

15:51.145 --> 15:53.075
...and give Kohryu a pleasant surprise!

15:53.485 --> 15:55.975
Okay, transform, Chibi!

15:57.915 --> 15:59.785
Wh-What's wrong?!

16:02.655 --> 16:03.955
Y-You're not saying...

16:03.995 --> 16:06.655
...you can't grow bigger
because you're hungry?

16:07.725 --> 16:09.095
You're kidding...

16:13.835 --> 16:15.395
R-Reiji!

16:15.705 --> 16:17.175
So it's made an appearance!

16:23.175 --> 16:24.575
Okay, Hikaru!

16:24.715 --> 16:26.335
Let's attack it from opposite sides!

16:26.515 --> 16:28.535
Hikaru's already flown off somewhere.

16:28.755 --> 16:29.615
What?!

16:32.585 --> 16:34.955
He pisses me off!

16:35.255 --> 16:36.285
Let's go, Chibi!

16:36.595 --> 16:37.855
W-Wait a minute!

16:38.155 --> 16:40.215
What should I do?!

16:44.035 --> 16:45.825
I can't see anything with all this fog.

16:51.435 --> 16:53.335
I can't see where we're being attacked from!

16:59.715 --> 17:01.305
That's good, Genwakumemu.

17:01.955 --> 17:04.355
R-Reiji.

17:08.155 --> 17:09.385
Reiji Ohzora.

17:09.595 --> 17:11.115
I'll be watching you to see how you fight.

17:11.965 --> 17:14.655
I'm interested in finding out
how you plan to defeat this.

17:19.605 --> 17:21.765
I see it! Chibi, that's it.

17:22.135 --> 17:23.565
Fire!

17:31.875 --> 17:33.975
Our attack had no effect on it.

17:34.185 --> 17:35.775
Because of those hard wings.

17:38.655 --> 17:40.515
If only this fog weren't here!

17:40.825 --> 17:41.815
This fog?

17:45.125 --> 17:46.115
I know!

17:46.365 --> 17:49.355
Chibi! Please transform, for just an instant!

17:52.705 --> 17:54.095
What's taking you so long?!

17:57.335 --> 18:01.065
Its weak point should be the eye
on its waist, below its wings.

18:01.405 --> 18:03.745
Three seconds after it releases the fog,
the wings close shut.

18:04.515 --> 18:06.415
A swirl forms in the stream of fog!

18:07.915 --> 18:10.175
The point is to aim at the center of that swirl!

18:11.185 --> 18:13.655
Its eye is there! Canopus!

18:17.455 --> 18:20.055
Three. Two. One.

18:21.625 --> 18:22.615
What?!

18:23.735 --> 18:26.295
Those wings are in the way!

18:33.575 --> 18:34.505
That's nuts!

18:35.075 --> 18:37.135
We missed our chance
to defeat it with one shot!

18:37.645 --> 18:38.635
However...

18:41.415 --> 18:43.005
What's going on?

18:44.155 --> 18:45.945
R-Reiji.

18:47.855 --> 18:49.155
The fog is lifting.

18:50.625 --> 18:53.325
S-So this is what
Genwakumemu looks like?!

18:55.065 --> 18:56.425
That's its weak point!

18:56.465 --> 18:57.725
Get it, Kohryu!

18:58.695 --> 19:01.195
Protect the village, self-defense trooper!

19:07.075 --> 19:08.005
Hey, look!

19:08.045 --> 19:09.565
Kohryu just defeated Genwakumemu!

19:16.055 --> 19:18.955
His plan to break its wings
rather than go for the eye is amateur...

19:19.125 --> 19:22.285
...but he did pick up on its weak point
in that short amount of time.

19:24.795 --> 19:26.455
Where do you think you're going?!

19:26.795 --> 19:29.125
There's no escaping now, Chief!

19:36.735 --> 19:38.035
So it was you after all!

19:38.335 --> 19:40.435
How dare you trick us for so long!

19:49.815 --> 19:51.185
Thanks for everything.

19:51.755 --> 19:53.545
Because you gave me the courage, Reiji...

19:53.585 --> 19:55.215
...I'm now a self-defense trooper.

19:55.455 --> 19:58.785
It's because of your strong will
to protect the village.

20:00.095 --> 20:04.225
By the way, I don't know if it's
the legendary dragon you're looking for...

20:04.965 --> 20:08.235
...but I heard that there is such a legend
of a dragon originating from that mountain.

20:08.335 --> 20:09.325
Really?

20:09.435 --> 20:11.095
Great news, right, Chibi?!

20:12.005 --> 20:14.275
Thank you! That mountain, right?!

20:14.405 --> 20:15.395
No, that way.

20:16.445 --> 20:17.675
W-Will you be all right?

20:20.845 --> 20:22.505
Huh? My sister?

20:22.885 --> 20:25.785
Yeah. She's asked me to find you
and bring you back.

20:28.585 --> 20:30.455
Well? Has he told her yet that he loves her?

20:30.695 --> 20:31.955
I can't tell.

20:32.025 --> 20:33.155
You think they'll kiss?

20:33.265 --> 20:34.595
I'm sure they will.

20:34.795 --> 20:38.425
- She'll say, "I've always loved you too."
- What're you doing?

20:40.005 --> 20:41.525
No! I can't return yet.

20:42.605 --> 20:43.765
I can't go back yet.

20:44.175 --> 20:45.965
There's still so much that I have to do here.

20:50.315 --> 20:53.335
- He's been dumped.
- Yeah. Well, too bad for him.

20:53.445 --> 20:54.675
Yeah.

20:58.355 --> 20:59.755
Do you really understand?

21:00.025 --> 21:03.515
Ultimately, your mission is to aid us
in taking over both Earth and Rikyu.

21:04.025 --> 21:05.725
Don't forget that.

21:06.325 --> 21:07.655
You're exaggerating.

21:07.765 --> 21:09.495
This is nothing but a game.

21:09.895 --> 21:10.885
What?

21:11.235 --> 21:12.355
I know.

21:12.565 --> 21:15.165
This time, I'll "clear" my mission for sure.

21:25.045 --> 21:26.375
Hikaru.

21:26.615 --> 21:28.345
How much further do you plan to follow us?

21:30.715 --> 21:32.245
Say something!

21:32.285 --> 21:33.985
You're being a pest!

21:55.975 --> 21:58.345
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.745 --> 22:01.075
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.415 --> 22:05.245
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.885 --> 22:09.325
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.695 --> 22:11.655
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.295 --> 22:16.225
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.795 --> 22:19.735
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.535 --> 22:22.935
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.205 --> 22:27.195
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.545 --> 22:31.065
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.415 --> 22:33.675
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.015 --> 22:38.885
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.585 --> 22:42.055
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.255 --> 22:44.885
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.025 --> 22:49.795
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.435 --> 22:52.865
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.205 --> 22:55.565
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.905 --> 23:00.635
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.175 --> 23:05.575
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.545 --> 23:12.285
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.585 --> 23:17.355
Next time

23:17.555 --> 23:21.555
Hikaru Himuro and Ichirou Sumishiba...
what in the world are those two thinking?!

23:21.765 --> 23:25.065
Hikaru persistently tags along with
Chibi and I, saying "fight me"...

23:25.095 --> 23:27.655
...and Ichirou strongly insists,
"accept me into your team."

23:29.105 --> 23:30.005
Wh-What?!

23:30.035 --> 23:32.365
Ichirou's lost it, and he's become violent?!

23:32.405 --> 23:33.375
Lost it!

23:33.405 --> 23:35.895
Next, on Dragon Drive,
"To the Legendary Mountain".

23:36.015 --> 23:38.775
What?! A prince arriving on a white horse?

23:38.845 --> 23:40.745
Wh-Why, that's!

23:41.385 --> 23:41.785
Sun Wols!

23:41.785 --> 23:43.315
To the Legendary Mountain
Sun Wols!

23:43.315 --> 23:44.405
To the Legendary Mountain
